        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Bowery Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bowery knob made by Schlage has a modern look that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. It is available in dummy, privacy, passage, keyed entry, and storeroom functions. Choose from a huge selection of beautiful finishes to show off your personal tastes. The universal latch of the chlage F-Series Bowery Door Knob Set fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Bowery Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the F-Series Schlage Bowery Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<!-- <li><b>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only):</b> Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside knob is always unlocked. The outside knob is fixed.</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bowery Door Knob",
                "description": "The Bowery knob made by Schlage has a modern look that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. It is available in dummy, privacy, passage, keyed entry, and storeroom functions. Choose from a huge selection of beautiful finishes to show off your personal tastes. The universal latch of the chlage F-Series Bowery Door Knob Set fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
